Boca Juniors, River Plate, Rangers, Dynamo Kyiv, Flamengo and Palmeiras are
excluded by product decision. A shared blocklist now applies at every point a
team can enter or be read: the sync skips their team rows (and the fixtures and
standings that would FK-fail without them), GET /api/teams filters them out,
GET /api/teams/:id 404s, and the static seed refuses to insert them.

